==In animation==
===''Pokémon the Series''===
[[File:Pokémon Breeder anime.png|thumb|250px|A Pokémon Breeder in {{aniseries|XY}}]]
The concept of Pokémon Breeders was first introduced in ''[[EP005|Showdown in Pewter City]]'', two [[generation]]s before the Trainer class was introduced in the {{pkmn|games}}. In {{aniseries|PTS}}, Pokémon Breeders typically concern themselves with {{DL|Pokémon training|raising Pokémon}} for health and [[friendship]], rather than for competitive fields like [[Gym]]s and [[Pokémon Contest]]s. However, they may participate in grooming competitions such as the [[Pokémon Beauty Contest]]. 

Aspects that Pokémon Breeders typically also handle or cover include [[Pokémon groomer|Pokémon grooming]] and [[Pokémon food|Pokémon nutrition]].

Breeders hatch, care for, and raise [[first partner Pokémon]] at secret breeding grounds as part of the [[Pokémon League]]'s system to distribute them to new Pokémon Trainers, as noted in ''[[AG025|A Mudkip Mission]]''.

A female Pokémon Breeder appeared in ''[[XY046|The Clumsy Crier Quiets the Chaos!]]''.

