==Trivia==
* While {{an|Brock}} has mentioned his interest in being a Pokémon Breeder since he was introduced in ''[[EP005|Showdown in Pewter City]]'', the Trainer class did not appear until [[Generation III]].
* For ''[[DP007|Like It or Lup It!]]'', [[Professor Oak's Big Pokémon Encyclopedia]] is about Pokémon Breeders. He writes this {{wp|senryū}} about them: 「ポケモンに　つくしてそだてる　ブリーダー」 ''"The Breeder who raises and devotes himself to Pokémon."''
* The [[Generation VII]] designs for the Pokémon Breeder class resemble the [[Generation IV]] Trainer classes {{tc|Rancher}} and {{tc|Cowgirl}}.
* In [[Pokémon GO]], "Breeder" is the name of an achievement {{GO|medal}} awarded for hatching at least 10 {{pkmn|Egg}}s.

